BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ev_orionids_1022-2026-10-23@coastaleventures.com
DTSTAMP:20261023T000000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20261023T031500
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20261023T041500
SUMMARY:Orionid Meteor Shower: Halley's Comet dust
LOCATION:Your own yard\, or Big Lagoon State Park for a darker sky\, 12301 
 Gulf Beach Hwy\, Pensacola\, FL 32507
DESCRIPTION:Thu 10/22/2026 · from 3:15 AM\, once the moon is down\n\nThese
  are crumbs off Halley's Comet hitting the air at forty-one miles a second
 . The catch this year is a fat gibbous moon that washes the sky out until 
 it sets at quarter past three\, which leaves about two and a half hours of
  real darkness before dawn on the 22nd.\n\nPrice: Free\n\nDetails: https:/
 /coastaleventures.com/events/ev-orionids-1022.html
URL:https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-orionids-1022.html
CATEGORIES:STEM and learning
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ev_usa_archaeology_museum_creepy_crawly_1024-2026-10-24@coastaleventure
 s.com
DTSTAMP:20261023T000000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20261024T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20261024T150000
SUMMARY:Creepy Crawly Halloween at the Museum
LOCATION:University of South Alabama Archaeology Museum\, 6050 USA Dr. S.\,
  Mobile\, AL 36688
DESCRIPTION:Saturday 10/24 · 10:00 AM to 3:00 PM\n\nA free family Hallowee
 n day at the university's archaeology museum includes a midday Creepy Craw
 ly Show and Tell led by USA Biology\, plus pumpkin painting\, a trick-or-t
 reat trail\, crafts and face painting. The museum is part of the Universit
 y of South Alabama campus.\n\nPrice: Free\n\nDetails: https://coastalevent
 ures.com/events/ev-usa-archaeology-museum-creepy-crawly-1024.html
URL:https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-usa-archaeology-museum-creepy-cr
 awly-1024.html
CATEGORIES:STEM and learning
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
